    {
      "anchor": "bayes",
      "heading": "2. Conditional Probability & Bayes' Theorem",
      "proseLatex": "$P(A|B) = P(A\\cap B)/P(B)$. Bayes: $P(A|B) = P(B|A)P(A)/P(B)$.",
      "keyFormulas": [
        {
          "formulaId": "M11-F02",
          "label": "Bayes' Theorem",
          "latex": "$P(A_i|E) = \\frac{P(E|A_i)P(A_i)}{\\sum_j P(E|A_j)P(A_j)}$",
          "aiExplainContext": "Reverse probability from cause to effect."
        }
      ]
    }
